  "description": "Codex / Codex-plugin tool bindings for adhoc-sdlc prompt templates. Codex names no dedicated question/subagent tool in its prose (speak in actions), so ASK/TODO render as descriptive phrases and the subagent via-clause is empty. Paths resolve against the installed skill dir (<skill-dir>). Output tree is the Codex plugin: plugins/adhoc-sdlc/.",
